An MCP server and CLI, published on npm as `@mackody/quickenrich-mcp`, that wraps Quick Enrich's APIs for agent prospecting workflows: person enrichment, reverse email and phone lookup, domain lead pulls and CSV/JSONL batch jobs, with API keys stored securely on the machine.
